      "note": "ODbL. Existing carriageways retained. Mature 17–20 metre canopy estimates remain on both sides north of the Leon Sa Aureus Street junction. The owner removes the authored avenue trees between that junction and the Panganiban crossing rotonda. Retained trunk positions, heights and crowns are unchanged; no mapped source trees or adjacent site landscaping are removed. North-side trunks clear full-width roads and standing roofs; estimated leaf overhang is intentional."
