    {
      "title": "Owner-supplied Magsaysay Avenue ground reference",
      "note": "Inspected 2026-10-02. Mature broad canopy is visible on both street sides and reaches above the road. Estimated crown dimensions remain draft; all mapped trunks/heights and road geometry are preserved. No reference bitmap ships."
    },
    {
      "title": "Owner-requested southern Magsaysay tree removal",
      "note": "2026-10-02 follow-up: remove avenue planting from the Leon SA Aureus Street intersection to the rotonda. Anchored to the shared source vertex [123.2008687, 13.6263647] of ways 23519204 and 252223483; the two southern split carriageways 252223486 and 721779873 connect toward rotonda 252223489. This supersedes southern planting from the earlier owner canopy request. The northern avenue, Balatas corridor and neighboring church/school planting remain. No historical tree-removal date is inferred."
    }
